- **`draft-ietf-sshm-strict-kex`**: Initiate a 3-week Working Group Last Call.
- **`draft-ietf-sshm-hostkey-update`**: Damien Miller to upload a refreshed draft version to clear the expired status.
- **`draft-ietf-sshm-composite-sigs`**: Damien Miller to add test vectors for the ML-DSA-87 / P-384 variant.
- **SSH Transport Compression**: Rich Salz to coordinate with researchers to draft an Internet-Draft proposing the deprecation or safe handling of SSH transport compression.